  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police (Polri) has officially reassigned high-ranking officials Irjen Slamet Uliandi, Ahrie Sonta, and Eko Hadi to the Yanma division following their involvement in a high-profile wiretapping case. Prior to this reassignment, Ahrie Sonta was removed from his position as the Head of the Legal Division of the Indonesian National Police (Kadivkum Polri). The legal proceedings relate to allegations of treason and illegal surveillance targeting President Prabowo. While several officers have faced dismissal from the force due to their involvement in the unauthorized wiretapping, the case remains under active investigation by Bareskrim Polri. Authorities are continuing to analyze evidence and testimony, including upcoming statements from key figures, to further determine the scope of the criminal activity and the potential involvement of other personnel in these serious security breaches.",
